VAR CurrentSales = SUM(Sales[Amount])
VAR LastYearSales = CALCULATE(SUM(Sales[Amount]), SAMEPERIODLASTYEAR(Calendar[Date]))
RETURN
CurrentSales - LastYearSales
🔹 9. Iterator Functions
SUMX(), AVERAGEX(), COUNTX(), MAXX(), MINX() etc.

Iterate through a table and return a single value.

