Total Profit = SUMX(Sales, Sales[Price] - Sales[Cost])
🔹 10. Advanced DAX
RANKX() – ranking

CROSSFILTER() – change cross filtering

RELATED() / RELATEDTABLE() – work across relationships

USERELATIONSHIP() – activate inactive relationship

