 Tips for Learning DAX
Understand the data model – relationships matter.

Start with simple measures, then move to advanced.

Practice CALCULATE() and FILTER() – key to mastering DAX.

Use DAX Studio or Power BI Performance Analyzer to test formulas.

Think in terms of row and filter context.

